# Project Title: AI-Powered Multimodal Construction Intelligence Platform

## 1. Project Overview

Build a modern, professional, responsive, full-stack web application called **BuildMind AI — AI-Powered Multimodal Construction Intelligence Platform**.

The platform should use multimodal artificial intelligence to assist construction professionals, civil engineers, contractors, project managers, architects, and real estate investors in construction planning, site monitoring, safety assessment, crack detection, property valuation, and decision-making.

The application must support three types of input:

* **Text:** Natural-language questions, construction descriptions, project requirements, and site observations.
* **Images:** Construction site photographs, building cracks, structural damage, and safety conditions.
* **Structured Data:** Project budgets, dimensions, material quantities, schedules, location information, and property details.

The goal is to create a functional, intelligent, visually impressive platform that combines AI-powered analysis with practical construction management tools.

Do not build just a static landing page. Create a complete web application with an interactive dashboard, working navigation, functional forms, image uploads, API integration, loading states, error handling, and AI-generated results.

